Nothing contained in this Agreement shall be construed as granting or conferring any ownership rights, license, patent, copyright, trademark, or trade secret rights to the Receiving Party in or to any Confidential Information disclosed. All Confidential Information remains the exclusive property of the Disclosing Party.

